/*!
@defgroup ptu
@ingroup mod_analog Programmable Delay Block (PTU)
@details 
The YTMicro SDK provides a peripheral driver for the Programmable Delay Block (PTU) module.

The PTU is a configurable counter that can generate events (triggers) that can be used by the ADC to start conversions
or routed through TMU to other modules in the device.
 */